  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{\\sum x_i^2}{n} \\geq\\left(\\frac{\\sum x_i}{n}\\right)^2 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow n \\geq 16\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
